{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近暖かくなってきて、\n早起きも辛くなくない季節に\nなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入社して早くも半月が経ち\n朝が苦手だった私も\n毎日決まった時間に起きれる\nようになったり、、、(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず、会社の方も\n頑張ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにね！今日はお昼ご飯に\n新玉ねぎのサラダと\nオムレツのお弁当を\n作って持って行きました(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもお見せ出来る\nビジュアルではなかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は写真を\n撮らなかったのですが、\nそのうちお弁当の写真とかも\n載せられたらなって思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの好きなお弁当のおかずは\nなんですかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作れそうなら挑戦してみます！\nお楽しみに～！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氣志團現象2014\n『極東ロックンロール・ハイスクール 第弍章』#34 乃木坂46 vs 氣志團 ～学生服反逆同盟～ライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15日はzeppで氣志團ライブでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれたままで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルール"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演しましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんとの距離が\nものすごく近かったので\n盛り上がりをリアルに\n体感することが出来て\n凄く楽しかったですー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当日のブログにしか\nお知らせが出来なかったのにも\n関わらず\n推しタオルや団扇も見つけられて\n感動でした(>_<)♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、\n私は氣志團さんと初めてお仕事を\nさせていただいたのですが、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋にはポップコーン機や\nソフトクリームメーカーなど\nいろんなものを用意して\n下さっていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更に！\nお土産にTシャツやタオルなども\nプレゼントしてくださりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もこんな気遣いのできる\n素敵な人になりたい(._.)♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氣志團のみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒にお仕事出来たら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(よろしく)お願いしますっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～本当\n夢のような楽しい1日だったな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった～～～（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺で、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/17/4162242/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴよぴよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眞衣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."}],"source":"archive"}